      <activity id="9d9049f6-8b59-5eec-b9bb-181d22e70bed" activityNameId="f0fbbe4b-c2ff-5ccf-ba38-900b936af05c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, passenger car, natural gas</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, passenger car, natural gas
Average data for the operation of an Euro-3 Swiss passenger car.;
UUID: bcf9d90a-3c05-3465-b2e7-31a0f06370cd
natural gas, production mix, at service station supplies are included. Direct airborne emissions of gaseous substances, particulate matters and heavy metals are accounted for. Heavy metal emissions to water and to soil are included. Tyre abrasion is included.
Location: Data refers to average transport conditions and kilometric performance of different passenger car categories in Switzerland.
Technology: Euro3
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: National statistics, data from technical institutions and literature data. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bcf9d90a-3c05-3465-b2e7-31a0f06370cd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
